id: 37
hanzi: 自然
pinyin: zì rán
level: HSK 5
part_of_speech: Noun

meanings_summary:
  en: nature; natural world; natural; spontaneous; of course
  es: naturaleza; mundo natural; natural; espontáneo; por supuesto

senses[3]{sense_number,part_of_speech,register,definition_en,definition_es,example_phrase}:
  1 | Noun | Standard | the physical world collectively, including plants, animals, landscapes, and phenomena; nature | la naturaleza; el mundo físico y biológico que nos rodea | 大自然的神奇造化 (the miraculous creation of Mother Nature)
  2 | Adjective | Standard | existing in or caused by nature; not artificial, forced, or affected; natural | natural; espontáneo; no forzado ni artificial | 表情十分自然 (facial expression is very natural)
  3 | Adverb | Standard | naturally; as a matter of course; of course | naturalmente; por supuesto; como es lógico | 只要努力，成绩自然会提高 (as long as you work hard, grades will naturally improve)

example_sentences[2]{id,hanzi,pinyin,en,es}:
  #1 | 济南的天然名泉是大自然恩赐的瑰宝，吸引着无数热爱自然山水的游人前来探访。 | Jǐnán de tiānrán míngquán shì dàzìrán ēncì de guībǎo, xīyǐn zhe wúshù rè'ài zìrán shānshuǐ de yóurén qiánlái tànfǎng. | Jinan's natural springs are treasures bestowed by Mother Nature, attracting countless travelers who revere natural landscapes. | Los manantiales naturales de Jinan son joyas brindadas por la naturaleza que atraen a incontables amantes del paisaje montaraz.
  #2 | 在新型生态建筑设计中，设计师巧妙引入自然采光与自然通风系统，大幅降低了建筑全周期的能耗水平。 | Zài xīnxíng shēngtài jiànzhù shèjì zhōng, shèjìshī qiǎomiào yǐnrù zìrán cǎiguāng yǔ zìrán tōngfēng xìtǒng, dàfú jiàngdī le jiànzhù quán zhōuqī de nénghào shuǐpíng. | In contemporary ecological architecture, designers ingeniously integrate natural daylighting and ventilation, slashing lifecycle energy consumption. | En la arquitectura bioclimática contemporánea, los diseñadores integran iluminación y ventilación naturales, rebajando drásticamente el consumo energético.

collocations[6]{hanzi,en}:
